{#
  BeMart admin Login-history list — EC-CUBE goLoginHistoryList (ログイン履歴).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Setting/System/login_history.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Setting/System/login_history.twig).

  Setting/System section, DATA/LIST page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The
  markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim
  from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound to the LoginHistory
  resource body (src/Resource/Page/Admin/LoginHistory.php — body carries
  `count` + `entries`, a list of {timestamp, loginId, success, clientIp}).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `canonical-path route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`.
   - The search-form card is ported as STATIC STRUCTURE: EC-CUBE renders
     the multi-keyword / IP / date-range / status filter through Symfony
     `form_widget(searchForm.*)`; the BeMart LoginHistory resource is a
     plain read endpoint (`onGet(limit)` — no server-side search), so
     each `form_widget` / `form_errors` call is OMITTED, leaving the
     surrounding `c-outsideBlock` markup. The omitted inputs are
     EC-CUBE-search-runtime — enumerated as residuals. FLAGGED: a future
     wave that adds a LoginHistory search resource + `<Name>Form` can
     restore the inputs.
   - `searchForm._token` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. Omitted.
   - `{% for LoginHistory in pagination %}` -> the resource body's
     `entries` list. EC-CUBE's `pagination` is a KnpPaginator object;
     BeMart's list endpoint returns the full collection (no server-side
     paging in scope), so the `pageMaxis` page-count <select> options
     and the `@admin/pager.twig` block render empty. Enumerated as
     residuals.
   - `LoginHistory.id` -> the LoginHistoryListFetched projection does not
     surface a row id (the fake log keys by timestamp). The ID column
     cell renders empty. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `LoginHistory.user_name` -> rebound to `entry.loginId`.
   - `LoginHistory.client_ip` -> rebound to `entry.clientIp`.
   - `LoginHistory.create_date|date_format` -> rebound to
     `entry.timestamp`; the body stores it as an ISO-8601 string already.
   - `LoginHistory.Status` (mtb_login_history_status master object) ->
     the projection carries `success` as a bare bool; the badge renders
     成功 / 失敗 from it, keeping EC-CUBE's `badge-ec-blue` /
     `badge-ec-red` class. The `Status.id == constant(...)` master-data
     check is EC-CUBE-runtime — enumerated as residual.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin-setting-system-login-history' %}
{% set title = 'ログイン履歴' %}
{% set sub_title = 'システム設定' %}

{% block main %}
<form name="search_form" id="search_form" method="post" action="">
    <div class="c-outsideBlock">
        <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents">
            <div class="row justify-content-start">
                <div class="col-6">
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="col-form-label" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="情報を入力して一覧の絞り込み検索ができます。より詳細な条件を指定するには［詳細検索］を開いてください。">ログインID・IPアドレス<i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i></label>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-inline-block mb-3 collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#searchDetail" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="searchDetail"><a><i class="fa fw-bold me-1 fa-plus-square-o"></i><span class="fw-bold">詳細検索</span></a></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="c-subContents ec-collapse collapse" id="searchDetail">
            <div class="row mb-2">
                <div class="col">
                    <div>
                        <label>ログインID</label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div>
                        <label>IPアドレス</label>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row mb-2">
                <div class="col">
                    <div>
                        <label>ログイン試行日</label>
                        <div class="row align-items-center">
                            <div class="col">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-auto text-center"><span>〜</span></div>
                            <div class="col">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div>
                        <label>ステータス</label>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="c-outsideBlock__contents mb-5">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5">検索</button>
        {% if count is defined and count %}
            <span class="fw-bold ms-2">検索結果：{{ count }}件が該当しました</span>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                {% if entries is not empty %}
                    <div class="row justify-content-between mb-2">
                        <div class="col-6"></div>

                        <div class="col-5 text-end">
                            {#Dropdown page count#}
                            <div class="d-inline-block me-2">
                                <select class="form-select" onchange="location = this.value;">
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-inline-block">
                                <div class="btn-group" role="group"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                            <table class="table">
                                <thead>
                                    <tr>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-3 ps-3">ID</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-3">ログインID</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-3 ps-3">IPアドレス</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-3">ログイン試行日</th>
                                        <th class="border-top-0 pt-2 pb-3">ステータス</th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                {% for LoginHistory in entries %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="align-middle ps-3">
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            {{ LoginHistory.loginId }}
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            {{ LoginHistory.clientIp }}
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            {{ LoginHistory.timestamp }}
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle">
                                            <span class="badge {% if LoginHistory.success %}badge-ec-blue{% else %}badge-ec-red{% endif %}">
                                                {{ LoginHistory.success ? '成功' : '失敗' }}
                                            </span>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                            <div class="row justify-content-md-center mb-4">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% else %}
                    <div class="card rounded border-0">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <div class="text-center text-muted mb-4 h5">検索条件に合致するデータが見つかりませんでした</div>
                            <div class="text-center text-muted">検索条件を変えて、再度検索をお試しください</div>
                            <div class="text-center text-muted">[詳細検索]も試してみましょう</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
{% endblock %}
